# No content conversion of any kind: what is committed is what gets checked out and archived, byte for byte.
# - The plugin directory (claude.ai/directory) refuses a repository whose archive differs from its content
#   (eol rules, filters, export-ignore, Git LFS).
# - The sh launcher must stay LF and adapter/mindslice.cmd CRLF, also in Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf;
#   both are committed with exactly those bytes, and build.py --check compares generated files byte for byte.
* -text

# Build output of build/build.py: committed because marketplaces install from the repository, but not hand-edited.
plugins/** linguist-generated=true
